{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12146","headline":"海畔秋思 · 钱起","name":"海畔秋思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匡济难道合，去留随兴牵。\n偶爲谢客事，不顾平子田。\n魏阙贲翘楚，此身长弃捐。\n箕裘空在念，咄咄谁推贤。\n无用即明代，养痾仍壮年。\n日夕望佳期，帝乡路几千。\n秋风晨夜起，零落愁芳荃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}